        "content": "Using docker container for a single `pg_dump` command seems to be an overkill. I think it is simpler either to `apt install postgresql` (with `pg_dump`) in a github runner either to `supabase db dump --db-url \"$supabase_db_url\" -f data.sql --data-only --use-copy` (as described [here](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/cli/github-action/backups#periodic-backups-workflow)).",
